<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Page Not Found</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; text-align: center; background-color: #f4f4f9; padding-top: 100px; }
        .error-container { display: inline-block; padding: 40px; background-color: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        h1 { font-size: 80px; margin: 0; color: #e74c3c; }
        h2 { color: #333; }
        p { color: #666; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        a { text-decoration: none; background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; transition: background 0.3s; }
        a:hover { background-color: #2980b9; }
        code { background: #eee; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <h1>404</h1>
        <h2>Oops! Page Not Found</h2>
        <p>The page you are looking for at <code><%= url %></code> does not exist.</p>
        <a href="/">Return to Home</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
